    "reason": "This record synthesizes the qualitative comparison between batch adsorption metrics (from other works) and pilot column breakthrough behavior reported in this paper. Because batch and column experiments differ in configuration, matrix, and contact time, the relationships are informative for scale-up concepts but not directly comparable as performance metrics.",
