        "S01-E06"
      ],
      "value": "Perfluoroalkyl acids (PFAAs), including PFSAs and PFCAs such as PFOS, evaluated both in batch ion exchange experiments (affinity constants, maximum capacities) and in pilot column breakthrough experiments."
